{
	"_comment": "Semantic tags added 2026-09-16 to widen small template pools (sittable / na_place / v_place / vehicle / mealtime / surface_body / duration / quiet_event). Applied by scripts/apply_semantic_tags.py, which also mirrors the result into starter_nouns_meta.csv. Every (template, noun) sentence produced by these tags was rendered and reviewed. 2026-10-03: 'adversity' (obstacles/circumstances) for the navzdory/nehledě na templates; every sentence was reviewed. 2026-10-03: pairing audit. '-tag' keys remove mis-tags; new tags (address_*, title, formal_title, region, indoor, dwelling, settlement, lockable, large_object, landmark, shade, paired_body, painless, mass, time_point, whole_span, in_time, unique_relation, institution, no_templates) let templates ask for the right kind of noun. 'mass' nouns are skipped by plural templates (engine/drill.ts). 2026-10-10: 'count_time' marks the time units counted after numbers (pět let, šest hodin). 2026-10-10: content sweep. 'pet' (animals one plays with) for \"Hraju si s ___\"; '-abstract' takes people, objects, places and clothing out of the abstract frames (___ existuje, ___ je v pořádku, Záleží na ___, Zabývám se ___). 2026-10-11: re-filed the people, objects and places that lost 'abstract' the day before, by analogy with tagged neighbours (lékař, zákazník, telefon, sporák, škola, náměstí).",
